      'v2.hero.title': 'A voice speaker for talking with GPT',
      'v2.hero.lead': 'The speaker talks with OpenAI over Wi-Fi, and this page describes how it was made and how to repeat it.',
      'v2.hero.image': 'Pytaichenko on a desk: a low round black case, the top covered in small holes, a thin white ring strip under it and a small microphone hole on the side',
