      'v2.parts.note.mic': 'Two round modules about 14 mm across, without header pins.',
      'v2.parts.note.amp': 'A board with a 7-pin header and a screw terminal block for the speaker.',
      'v2.parts.note.speaker': 'The case is fitted to exactly this speaker. You need the 8 Ω version.',
      'v2.parts.note.filament': 'You need one Ø1.5 mm filament in this variant: 3 V, about 185 mm, 100 mA. The colour of the light is up to you. The 47 Ω resistor from 5 V assumes a 3 V filament, so check the variant on the product page.',
      'v2.parts.note.inserts': 'You need 9 M2.5 inserts (4 mm long, Ø3.5 mm).',
      'v2.parts.note.screws': 'You need 9 screws for a Phillips screwdriver.',
      'v2.parts.note.wires': 'Thin stranded wire, 26–30 AWG, in nine colours.',
      'v2.parts.note.charger': 'A cable that carries data, not only for charging. The bushing in the case opening fits a USB-C plug body of 10 × 6.2 mm; for a thicker plug (up to 12 × 7 mm) leave the bushing out.',
      'v2.parts.note.petg_black': 'Body, top, tray, button cap, three plugs. Part of a spool is used.',
      'v2.parts.note.petg_white': 'The ring arc.',
      'v2.parts.note.tpu': 'Three gaskets, four feet, the cable bushing.',
