      'v2.tools.item.tape': 'Masking tape for the L and R tags on the microphone wires and for the filament resistor (or heat-shrink)',
      'v2.print.intro': 'The case is printed in PETG and TPU. Each part name links to its STL file; every file holds one part, and the number in the file name (_x3, _x4) says how many copies to print.',
      'v2.print.common': 'The parts were printed on a Bambu Lab X1 Carbon: 0.4 mm nozzle, 0.2 mm first layer, Arachne walls. Any printer that prints PETG and TPU will do.',
      'v2.print.archive': 'All files in one archive (ZIP)',
      'v2.print.archive_note': 'The archive is built when the site is published, so a cloned repository does not have it: there the same files are in the v2/case/stl folder.',
      'v2.print.name.top': 'Top (sunflower grille, button holder, speaker posts)',
